  Licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0.

Major changes from the original:
  - Renamed the application and package to SilentPaper / com.silent.paper.
  - Removed all Xposed integration.
  - Removed all Root functionality (libsu, root shell, force-stop, root cleanup).
  - Removed the Yota EPD refresh management, refresh modes and screen/page animations.
  - Removed the control center, gesture service and notification/media reader.
  - Removed the proprietary Yota SDK stub from the build.
  - Added the home top style variants and the line/solid status icon styles.
  - Reworked launcher icons and Wi-Fi transfer for Android 4.2 compatibility.

